  "implementation": [
    "One private immutable verified GET-owned chunk, at most16MiB, within existing32MiB retained owning budget and256 response/payload entries. Exact Vec capacity/key/Arc/slot plus responses/ring/certificates/pending proofs and256KiB socket reservation are charged.",
    "Ordinary verified GET admission only. PUT/import/startup/recovery/stats/planning never populate it. Successful push clears response-only gauges while the immutable slot may survive; productive pressure can evict it.",
    "Whole descriptor graph validated before reads; exact cached/first-missing/remaining verified chunks merge in original order before native files. Existing opaque authenticated selection binds full stable selection and cache/missing partition without Worker framing changes.",
    "Stable one-use Full receive token is minted after complete reconstruction and is independent of its own admission. Changed cache/authority discards and charges paid bytes, then uses an explicit safe ordinary path before mutation. All-cache uses existing fresh authority and no dummy GET.",
    "Strict thin/ref/quarantine, publication-sync-before-delete, unknown receipt semantics, no replay and SAME Native physical GC-before-next-PUT remain intact."
  ],
